/target

# Temporary test outputs
*.mp4
*.m3u8
*.ts
log.txt

# ...but tests/fixtures/ holds checked-in inputs, not output. Without this,
# `*.mp4` and `*.ts` silently swallow new fixtures: the tests pass locally
# off an untracked file and CI fails to compile them (include_bytes!).
!tests/fixtures/**

# Editor files
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
